[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16742.709, "timestamp": "04:39:02", "text": "与星座和夜空对话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16744.551, "timestamp": "04:39:04", "text": "塔楼上方？我来自星星。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16746.629, "timestamp": "04:39:06", "text": "你愿意吗？你愿意吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16750.47, "timestamp": "04:39:10", "text": "有兴趣展示令人难以置信的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16760.23, "timestamp": "04:39:20", "text": "迷人。是的。我希望天文节目正在播出。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16762.709, "timestamp": "04:39:22", "text": "我的日程安排。听起来很有意思。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16764.709, "timestamp": "04:39:24", "text": "是。我有个好消息要告诉你。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16767.109, "timestamp": "04:39:27", "text": "绝对会选择天文学。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16769.59, "timestamp": "04:39:29", "text": "所有五年级学生必修。你会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16772.31, "timestamp": "04:39:32", "text": "被这座塔深深吸引。此外，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16774.629, "timestamp": "04:39:34", "text": "优质望远镜可以让你看到很多东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16777.35, "timestamp": "04:39:37", "text": "你做梦都想不到的。我想我到时候就知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16780.23, "timestamp": "04:39:40", "text": "当时你在课堂上。是的。哦，还有说话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16782.31, "timestamp": "04:39:42", "text": "班级里，最好先拿到我的第一个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16783.99, "timestamp": "04:39:43", "text": "年。没有什么比新鲜空气的味道更棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16787.51, "timestamp": "04:39:47", "text": "有羊皮纸吗？再见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16790.31, "timestamp": "04:39:50", "text": "嗨，回头见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16793.83, "timestamp": "04:39:53", "text": "向山姆自我介绍一下。阿曼达是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16796.39, "timestamp": "04:39:56", "text": "我非常喜欢。我的天哪，这太酷了！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16798.47, "timestamp": "04:39:58", "text": "你看，每个人都有自己的圈子。这是"}]